ection></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Part.1</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>时间及方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>2025年8月28至29日，线下方式开展活动。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Part.2</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>主要内容</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><ul><li><p><span>8月27日：海口市外营员可以入住酒店；</span></p></li><li><p><span> 8月28日（第二日）：9:00前全体营员报到，举办开营仪式、学术报告；参观学校校史馆、科研平台</span></p></li><li><p><span>8月29日：参观院史长廊、各系、室科研平台、医院教学介绍、科研平台介绍、师生交流及面试；</span></p></li><li><p><span>8月29日：17:00闭幕、离营。</span></p></li></ul></section><section><p><strong><span>注：日程以实际安排为准</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><ul><li><p><span>请认真填写各项信息，并保证所填数据真实可靠，如因材料虚假或其他不端行为导致的一切后果，由申请者承担。</span></p></li><li><p><span>报名时手机号码和电子邮箱务必填写准确，以免影响通知正常接收。</span></p></li><li><p><span>入营通知将以邮件形式发送，请注意查收。</span></p></li><li><p><span>入选同学须在报到时提交报名申请表、所有附件材料原件及复印件以备查验。</span></p></li><li><p><span>本次夏令营不收取任何费用，学院为营员提供活动期间的伙食、住宿（海口本地高校营员只提供伙食）；交通费用由营员自理。</span></p></li><li><p><span>面试由营员进行简要汇报，主要内容为自我简介，包含获奖情况、科研经历和学业成绩等。</span></p></li></ul></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>联 系 人：林老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0898-68601150</span></p><p><span>邮    箱：hghdwxsgzb@163.com</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/JQibXXsgWp5qnzsL9plpW5GAice5UurRUtabEwGgKWh1O2sjBjZY2ZPj7y4bgpqpiaBd7NIZbc5AHft4BYeOhSl4A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>来源 | 研究生办</span></p><p><span>审核 | 林雨</span></p><p><span>责编 | 吴蕾</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"0bf9b10a328a893893d08e1c8cf3eabba2ab8a3895a29d14623e314765df1af0","textLength":1797,"sourceSha256":"0b5e63c36df72b0e6e982f358be250f83cb029b